  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Symposium - 2024 Indo-Pacific Business Forum Technical Symposium, through The Webster Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contract funds the 2024 Indo Pacific Business Forum, which brings together senior U.S. and regional government officials with business officials to advance the objectives of the Indo-Pacific vision. The Forum would be held as a hybrid event, with a 500 in-person element held in Manila, Philippines and an anticipated 1,500-person online audience. The event will include representatives from across the Indo-Pacific.</narrative>
  </description>
